<title>USA: Equity offering ends Service Corp's stake.</title>
<headline>Equity offering ends Service Corp's stake.</headline>
<dateline>LUFKIN, TX 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Corp International said Wednesday it completed a public offering of common stock at $19.25 per share, which included 7,994,522 shares offered by Service Corp International as well as 1,199,178 shares issued by Equity Corp.</p>
<p>As a result of the offering, Service Corp International no longer has any ownership or financial interest in Equity Corp said the company.</p>
<p>Service Corp will receive the net proceeds from 7,994,522 shares, while Equity Corp will receive about $22.1 million from 1,199,178 shares, which will be used to repay outstanding debt.</p>
</text>
